<div class="panel">
  <div class="topline">
    <h1>🏆 {{ t('Top Picks', '精选股') }}</h1>
    <span class="muted sm">{{ t('holistic conviction across the S&P 1500 — ranked by what to own, flagged for when to buy', '覆盖标普 1500 的综合信念 — 按“持有什么”排名，并标注“何时买入”') }}</span>
  </div>
  <p class="muted sm note">{{ t(
    "Two axes, kept honest and separate. CONVICTION (the rank) = a validated alpha-led blend: sector-neutral residual momentum (the only individually positive-IC leg) plus a light multi-factor confirmation — value, quality, profitability, low-vol and insider buying. ENTRY (a separate column) = a leader on a recent pullback is a constructive 'buy zone'; one that just spiked is 'extended' (wait). We DON'T fold entry into the rank: unlike China's A-shares (which mean-revert), US leaders keep running, so a reversal tilt in the rank measurably hurts (reports/top-picks-phase0.md). The blend beat residual-momentum alone on point-in-time IC at every horizon, but it's a modest, decayed, crowded edge — a research lens with an entry read, not a guaranteed buy list.",
    "两个维度，保持诚实且分离。信念（排名）= 经验证的以阿尔法为主的混合：板块中性残差动量（唯一单独正 IC 的因子）加上轻度多因子确认——价值、质量、盈利、低波动与内部人买入。入场（单独一列）= 处于近期回调的领先股为建设性“可建仓”；刚刚飙升的为“过热”（等待）。我们不把入场折入排名：与会均值回归的中国 A 股不同，美股领先股会延续，因此在排名中加入反转倾斜会明显损害收益（reports/top-picks-phase0.md）。该混合在每个时间跨度的点对点 IC 上都优于单独的残差动量，但属温和、已衰减、拥挤的边际信号——是带入场读数的研究视角，而非保证买入清单。") }}</p>
  <p class="muted sm" style="margin:6px 0 0">{{ t('As of', '截至') }} {{ as_of }} · {{ n }} {{ t('names', '只') }} ·
    {{ t('score', '评分') }} {{ alpha_w }}·α + {{ tilt_w }}·{{ t('conviction', '信念') }} ·
    {{ t('betas', '贝塔') }} {{ windows.beta_win }}d · {{ t('formation', '形成窗口') }} {{ windows.form }}-{{ windows.skip }}d</p>
</div>

{% if banner and banner.state and banner.state != 'na' %}
<div class="cohort {{ banner.state }}">
