  <span><b>{{ t('Leadership cohort', '领先股群体') }}:</b>
    {% if banner.state == 'stretched' %}{{ t('stretched', '过度拉伸') }}{% elif banner.state == 'elevated' %}{{ t('elevated', '偏高') }}{% else %}{{ t('normal', '正常') }}{% endif %}</span>
  <span class="muted sm">{{ banner.pct_stretched }}% {{ t('stretched / parabolic', '拉伸/抛物') }} ·
    {{ t('median extension', '中位拉伸') }} {{ '%+.1f'|format(banner.median_ext_z) }}σ ·
    {{ banner.pct_at_highs }}% {{ t('pressing highs', '逼近新高') }}</span>
  {{ help('How stretched the top-conviction leaders are versus their OWN history. A fragility / size-DOWN gauge for the whole book — crowding and stretch raise crash *probability*, they do NOT time the market (we tested: no extension screen reduces drawdown, and narrow markets can grind higher for a long time). Never a fade, never changes the rank. When stretched, prefer smaller size and in-trend names over parabolic ones.', '顶端高信念领先股相对其自身历史的拉伸程度。面向整体仓位的脆弱性/减仓提示——拥挤与拉伸提高崩跌“概率”，但并不择时（我们验证过：任何拉伸筛选都不会降低回撤）。绝非反向做空，也不改变排名。拉伸时宜减小仓位、偏好趋势内而非抛物个股。') }}
</div>
{% endif %}

{% if buyzone %}
<div class="panel">
