    {{ help('The sweet spot: high-conviction Top Picks that are ALSO a sector leader on a recent pullback (not extended) — a constructive entry into a high-quality leader rather than chasing one that just ran. Entry is a risk-placement read, not a return prediction.', '最佳交集：既是高信念精选、又是处于近期回调（而非过热）的板块领先股——以建设性方式进入优质领先股，而不是追高。入场为风险定位读数，而非收益预测。') }}</h2>
